  "notes": "https://cursor.com/careers is a Next.js page whose React Server Components flight data embeds the complete Ashby job array (118 postings carrying id, title, department, team, employmentType, location, secondaryLocations, workplaceType, isRemote, publishedAt, jobUrl, applyUrl). The same records are served by the public Ashby posting API GET https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/cursor, which answers 200 with {jobs:[...118...]} but accepts no filter or sort parameters, and the adapter reads the official page's own flight data rather than starting a board crawl. Every control therefore has to be applied locally over the full array; the array's own order (publishedAt) is the only ordering available.",
